msgstr "備份進行中"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:137 aot_flask/routes_admin.py:162
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not enough free space to perform a backup. A backup requires "
"%(size_bu).1f MB but there is only %(size_free).1f MB available, which "
"would leave %(size_after).1f MB after the backup. If the free space after"
" a backup is less than 50 MB, the backup cannot proceed. Free up space by"
" deleting current backups."
msgstr ""
"沒有足夠的可用空間可執行備份。備份需要 %(size_bu).1f MB，但目前僅有 %(size_free).1f MB 可用，備份後將剩餘 "
"%(size_after).1f MB。若備份後的可用空間低於 50 MB，將無法進行備份。請刪除現有備份以釋放空間。"

