msgstr "正在等待更新程式啟動..."

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:658
msgid "Enter the update time as HH:MM (24-hour), e.g. 03:00."
msgstr "請以 HH:MM（24 小時制）格式輸入更新時間，例如 03:00。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:688
msgid ""
"Saved, but the daemon could not be notified. The new schedule takes "
"effect after the daemon restarts."
msgstr "已儲存，但無法通知常駐程式。新的排程將在常駐程式重新啟動後生效。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:694
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are on. A published update will be installed at "
"%(time)s each day."
msgstr "自動更新已開啟。每天 %(time)s 會安裝已發布的更新。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:698
msgid "Automatic updates are off."
msgstr "自動更新已關閉。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:724
msgid ""
"In-app upgrade is not available without the updater service. On the host,"
" pull the new image and recreate the containers (docker compose pull && "
"docker compose up -d) instead."
msgstr "沒有更新程式服務時，無法在應用程式內升級。請改為在主機上拉取新映像檔並重新建立容器 (docker compose pull && docker compose up -d)。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:728
msgid "An update is already in progress."
msgstr "已有更新正在進行中。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:735
#, python-format
msgid "You are already on the latest version (%(version)s)."
msgstr "您已是最新版本 (%(version)s)。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:751
msgid ""
"The update has been requested. The containers will be recreated on the "
"new image; this page shows progress."
msgstr "已提出更新要求。容器將以新映像檔重新建立，此頁面會顯示進度。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:832
msgid ""
"There was an error encountered during the upgrade process. Check the "
"upgrade log for details."
msgstr "升級過程中發生錯誤。請查看升級記錄以取得詳細資訊。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:886
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A backup must be performed during an upgrade and there is not enough free"
" space to perform a backup. A backup requires %(size_bu).1f MB but there "
"is only %(size_free).1f MB available, which would leave %(size_after).1f "
"MB after the backup. If the free space after a backup is less than 50 MB,"
" the backup cannot proceed. Free up space by deleting current backups."
msgstr ""
"升級過程中必須執行備份，但目前沒有足夠的可用空間可執行備份。備份需要 %(size_bu).1f MB，但目前僅有 %(size_free).1f"
" MB 可用，備份後將剩餘 %(size_after).1f MB。若備份後的可用空間低於 50 MB，將無法進行備份。請刪除現有備份以釋放空間。"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:919
msgid "The upgrade (from master branch) has started"
msgstr "升級已開始（master 分支）"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:937
msgid "The upgrade has started"
msgstr "升級已開始"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:958
msgid "The major version upgrade has started"
msgstr "主要版本升級已開始"

#: aot_flask/routes_admin.py:961
