"AoT is an open-source monitoring and control system built around a GIS "
"digital twin and an MCP-based AI assistant. Some parts derive from the "
"open-source Mycodo project; a warranty for the software added by AoT is "
"available under a separate contract. The parts related to AoT follow the "
