#: functions/example_function_all_options.py:41
msgid ""
"This function module is an example demonstrating the various UI option "
"types. It is intended only for learning how to develop new custom "
"function modules and has no other practical use. This message is "
"displayed above the function options. This function retrieves the last "
"selected measurement, turns the selected output on for 15 seconds, and "
"then deactivates it. Analyze the code to develop your own function module"
" and configure it so it can be imported from the Function Import page."
msgstr ""
"此功能模組是展示各種 UI "
"選項類型的範例,僅用於學習如何開發新的自訂功能模組,並無其他實際用途。此訊息顯示在功能選項上方。此功能會取得最後選定的測量值,將選定的輸出開啟 "
"15 秒後再停用。請分析程式碼以開發您自己的功能模組,並進行設定,使其可從功能匯入(Function Import)頁面匯入。"

