#: functions/function_adafruit_neokey_01.py:129
msgid ""
"This function executes specific actions when a key is pressed. After "
"adding actions at the bottom of this module, enter one or more short "
"action IDs for each key, separated by commas. The action ID can be found "
"next to each action (for example, for \"[Action 0559689e] Controller: "
"Activate\" the action ID is 0559689e). When entering action IDs, separate"
" multiple IDs with commas (for example, \"asdf1234\" or "
"\"asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987\"). Actions are executed in the order of the"
" entered text string. Enter the action IDs to execute when a key is "
"pressed. If you enable the toggle action, the actions listed in the "
"toggled action IDs are executed on alternate key presses. You can set the"
" LED color before a key is pressed, after it is pressed, and while the "
"last action is executing. The color is an RGB string with values in the "
"range 0 to 255. For example, enter \"255, 0, 0\" for red and \"0, 0, "
"255\" for blue."
msgstr ""
"此功能會在按下按鍵時執行特定動作。在此模組底部新增動作後,請為每個按鍵輸入一個或多個簡短的動作 ID,並以逗號分隔。動作 ID "
"可在各動作旁找到(例如「[Action 0559689e] Controller: Activate」的動作 ID 為 "
"0559689e)。輸入動作 ID 時,多個 ID "
"請以逗號分隔(例如「asdf1234」或「asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987」)。動作會依輸入文字字串的順序執行。請輸入按下按鍵時要執行的動作"
" ID。若啟用切換動作,則每次交替按下按鍵時會執行切換動作 ID 中列出的動作。您可以設定按鍵按下前、按下後,以及最後一個動作執行期間的 LED "
"顏色。顏色為 RGB 字串,數值範圍為 0 到 255。例如,紅色請輸入「255, 0, 0」,藍色請輸入「0, 0, 255」。"

