#: functions/pid_autotune.py:41
msgid "PID Autotune"
msgstr "PID 自動調校"

#: functions/pid_autotune.py:43
msgid ""
"This function attempts to automatically tune a PID controller. That is, "
"it enables the output and measures the response from the sensor multiple "
"times to calculate the P, I, and D gain values. Updates on the operating "
"status are written to the daemon log, and when autotuning completes "
"successfully a summary is also stored in the daemon log. Only raising the"
" current measurement is supported; lowering the measurement may require "
"some modification of the controller code. To monitor whether the output "
"is normally raising the measurement above the setpoint, it is recommended"
" to graph the measurement and output on the dashboard. The autotune "
"feature is experimental and not fully developed. It is likely it will not"
" generate proper PID gains, so it is recommended not to rely on this "
"function for accurate PID controller tuning."
msgstr ""
"此功能會嘗試自動調校 PID 控制器，也就是啟用輸出並多次測量感測器的回應，以計算 P、I、D 增益值。運作狀態的更新會寫入 daemon "
"日誌，自動調校成功完成後，摘要資訊也會儲存在 daemon "
"日誌中。目前僅支援提升測量值的動作；若要降低測量值，可能需要對控制器程式碼進行一些修改。若要監控輸出是否正常地將測量值提升到設定值以上，建議在儀表板上將測量值與輸出繪製成圖表。自動調校功能屬於實驗性質，尚未完全開發完成，很可能無法產生正確的"
" PID 增益值，因此建議不要依賴此功能來進行精確的 PID 控制器調校。"

#: functions/pid_autotune.py:103
msgid "Noise Band"
msgstr "雜訊帶"

#: functions/pid_autotune.py:112
msgid "Outstep"
msgstr "輸出步階"

#: functions/redundancy.py:45
msgid "Redundant Sensor Data"
msgstr "備援感測器資料"

#: functions/redundancy.py:49
msgid ""
"This function stores the first available measurement. It is useful when "
"you want to configure multiple sensors for backup. If you order the "
"sensors by priority, this function checks the first measurement for "
"existence, and if absent, checks the next measurement, repeating the "
"process. When a measurement is found, it is stored in the database with "
"the custom measurement and unit. The output of this function can be used "
"as an input throughout AoT. If you need to check three or more "
"measurements, you can chain multiple redundancy functions by setting the "
"output of the first function as the input of the second."
msgstr ""
"此功能會儲存最先取得的可用測量值，適合用於將多個感測器設為備援時使用。若依優先順序排列感測器，此功能會先檢查第一個測量值是否存在，若不存在則檢查下一個測量值，並依此類推。找到測量值後，會以自訂的測量值與單位儲存至資料庫。此功能的輸出可在整個"
" AoT 中作為輸入使用。若需要檢查三個以上的測量值，可將第一個功能的輸出設為第二個功能的輸入，依此串接多個備援功能。"

#: functions/regulate_ph_ec.py:41
msgid "pH, EC Regulation"
msgstr "pH、EC 調節"

#: functions/regulate_ph_ec.py:45
msgid ""
"This function uses two pumps (acid and base solutions) to regulate pH, "
"and can use up to four pumps (A, B, C, D nutrient solutions) to regulate "
"electrical conductivity (EC). You only need to configure the nutrient "
"solution outputs you intend to use. Outputs that are not configured are "
"not activated during EC adjustment, and you can use from one to four "
"pumps. Outputs can operate in units of duration (seconds) or volume (ml),"
" and each output type must be matched to the selected output channel (an "
"on/off output channel for duration control, a volume output channel for "
"volume control). The mixing ratio of the nutrient solutions is determined"
" by the duration or volume setting of each EC output. If you enter an "
"email address (or multiple addresses separated by commas) in the email "
"notification field, a notification email is sent in the following cases. "
"<br>1) when the pH value goes outside the configured danger range, 2) "
"when the EC value is too high and water must be added to the storage "
"tank, 3) when no measurement can be found in the database within a given "
"Max Age range. <br>Each email notification type has its own timer so that"
" the same notification is not sent repeatedly, and the same notification "
"is not sent for the duration of the configured email timer. <br>Once this"
" duration elapses, the timer resets automatically, allowing a new "
"notification to be sent. You can also manually reset the email timers "
"using the Custom Commands below. <br>When the function is enabled, status"
" text is displayed at the bottom of the screen showing the regulation "
"information and the total duration/volume of each output."
msgstr ""
"此功能使用兩個幫浦（酸性與鹼性溶液）來調節 pH 值，並可使用最多四個幫浦（A、B、C、D "
"營養液）來調節電導度（EC）。您只需設定實際要使用的營養液輸出即可，未設定的輸出在 EC "
"調整時不會啟動，可使用一個到四個幫浦不等。輸出可以以時間（秒）或體積（ml）為單位運作，且每種輸出類型必須與所選的輸出通道相符（時間控制對應開關輸出通道，體積控制對應體積輸出通道）。營養液的混合比例是由各"
" EC 輸出的時間或體積設定所決定。若在電子郵件通知欄位中輸入電子郵件地址（或以逗號分隔的多個地址），則會在下列情況下發送通知郵件：<br>1) "
"pH 值超出設定的危險範圍時，2) EC 值過高、需要為儲液槽加水時，3) 在指定的 Max Age "
"範圍內於資料庫中找不到測量值時。<br>每種電子郵件通知類型都有各自的計時器，以避免重複發送相同通知；在設定的郵件計時器持續時間內，不會重複發送相同的通知。<br>此持續時間結束後，計時器會自動重設，允許發送新的通知。您也可以使用下方的自訂命令（Custom"
" Commands）手動重設郵件計時器。<br>啟用此功能後，畫面下方會顯示狀態文字，呈現調節資訊以及各輸出的總時間/總體積。"

#: functions/statistics_last_multiple.py:81
msgid "Statistics (Last, Multiple)"
msgstr "統計 (Last, Multiple)"

#: functions/statistics_last_multiple.py:85
msgid ""
"This function retrieves multiple measurements, calculates statistics, and"
" stores the results with the selected unit."
msgstr "此功能會取得多個測量值、計算統計數據，並以選定的單位儲存結果。"

#: functions/statistics_past_single.py:79
msgid "Statistics (Past, Single)"
msgstr "統計 (Past, Single)"

#: functions/statistics_past_single.py:83
msgid ""
"This function retrieves multiple values from a single measurement, "
"calculates statistics, and stores the results with the selected unit."
msgstr "此功能會從單一測量值中取得多筆數值、計算統計數據，並以選定的單位儲存結果。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:59
msgid "Sum (Accumulate / Point)"
msgstr "加總 (累積 / 時間點)"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:64
msgid ""
"Sums a single measurement source over time. Interval mode sums every "
"value between cycles (per-cycle usage). Point mode samples one value at a"
" recurring time-of-day (every N hours, in the device timezone) and sums "
"the most recent N snapshots. The result is stored with the selected "
"measurement and unit."
msgstr ""
"隨時間加總單一測量值來源。間隔模式會加總各週期之間的所有數值（每週期用量）；時間點模式則在固定的重複時刻（依裝置時區、每隔 N "
"小時）取樣一個數值，並加總最近的 N 筆快照。結果會以選定的測量值與單位儲存。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:82
msgid "Interval sum (between cycles)"
msgstr "間隔加總（週期之間）"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:83
msgid "Point sum (value at a recurring time)"
msgstr "時間點加總（重複時刻的數值）"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:85
msgid "Sum Mode"
msgstr "加總模式"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:87
msgid ""
"Interval: sum all values in the [previous run, now] window. Point: sum "
"the most recent N snapshot values."
msgstr "間隔：加總[前次執行, 現在]區間內的所有數值。時間點：加總最近 N 筆快照數值。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:100
msgid "The single measurement source to sum"
msgstr "要加總的單一測量值來源"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:118
msgid "[Interval mode] The duration between sums"
msgstr "[間隔模式] 各次加總之間的時間長度"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:125
msgid "Snapshot Time (HH:MM)"
msgstr "快照時間 (HH:MM)"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:127
msgid ""
"[Point mode] Time-of-day anchor for snapshots in the device timezone "
"(e.g. 00:00). Use 24:00 for midnight."
msgstr "[時間點模式] 依裝置時區設定快照的基準時刻（例如 00:00）。午夜請使用 24:00。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:136
msgid "Snapshot Interval"
msgstr "快照間隔"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:136
msgid "Hours"
msgstr "小時"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:138
msgid ""
"[Point mode] Hours between snapshots, starting from the anchor (e.g. 24 ="
" once daily, 6 = four times daily)"
msgstr "[時間點模式] 從基準時刻起算的快照間隔小時數（例如 24 = 每天一次，6 = 每天四次）"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:147
msgid "Point Count (N)"
msgstr "時間點數量 (N)"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:149
msgid "[Point mode] Number of most-recent snapshot values to sum"
msgstr "[時間點模式] 要加總的最近快照數值筆數"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:156
msgid "Force the sum logic to run immediately, regardless of the period timer"
msgstr "不論週期計時器為何，強制立即執行加總邏輯"

#: functions/sum_last_multiple.py:49
msgid "Sum (Last, Multiple)"
msgstr "加總 (Last, Multiple)"

#: functions/sum_last_multiple.py:53
msgid ""
"This function retrieves the last value of each selected measurement, sums"
" them, and stores the result with the selected measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能會取得各選定測量值的最後一筆數值並加總，然後以選定的測量值與單位儲存結果。"

#: functions/sum_past_single.py:49
msgid "Sum (Past, Single)"
msgstr "加總 (Past, Single)"

#: functions/sum_past_single.py:53
msgid ""
"This function retrieves past measurements (within Max Age) of the "
"selected measurement, sums them, and stores the result with the selected "
"measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能會取得選定測量值的過去數值（於 Max Age 範圍內）並加總，然後以選定的測量值與單位儲存結果。"

#: functions/vapor_pressure_deficit.py:50
msgid "Vapor Pressure Deficit (AVPD)"
msgstr "飽和水氣壓差 (AVPD)"

#: functions/vapor_pressure_deficit.py:53
msgid ""
"This function calculates the Vapor Pressure Deficit (AVPD) using leaf "
"temperature and humidity."
msgstr "此功能使用葉溫與濕度計算飽和水氣壓差（AVPD）。"

#: functions/verification.py:45
msgid "Data Verification"
msgstr "資料驗證"

#: functions/verification.py:49
msgid ""
"This function acquires two measurements, calculates their difference, and"
" stores Measurement A if the difference is not greater than the "
"configured threshold. This lets you verify one sensor's measurement "
"against another sensor's measurement. Since the measurement is only "
"stored when the two sensors agree, you can use the stored measurement in "
"Conditional Functions and similar to notify the user when no measurement "
"is present, indicating a possible sensor problem."
msgstr ""
"此功能會取得兩個測量值並計算其差值，若差值不大於設定的閾值，則儲存測量值 "
"A。透過此方式可將一個感測器的測量值與另一個感測器的測量值互相驗證。由於只有在兩個感測器數值一致時才會儲存測量值，您可在條件式函式（Conditional"
" Functions）等功能中使用該儲存值，在測量值不存在時通知使用者，藉此提示感測器可能發生問題。"

