"Retries per request before it is treated as failed. Keep this low: a high"
" value multiplies how long an unreachable device blocks a command"
msgstr "請求在被視為失敗之前的每次重試次數。請保持較低——數值過高會使無法連線的裝置卡住指令的時間成倍增加"

