msgstr "AoT 致動器位置"

#: widgets/AoT_output_value.py:62
msgid ""
"Displays and controls a positional (open/close) actuator: close/stop/open"
" buttons plus a fine-adjust slider."
msgstr "顯示並控制位置式（開啟/關閉）致動器：關閉／停止／開啟按鈕，加上微調滑桿。"

#: widgets/AoT_output_value.py:77
msgid "Select the actuator to display and control"
msgstr "選擇要顯示與控制的致動器"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py:352
msgid "AoT Plot"
msgstr "AoT 地塊"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py:357
msgid ""
"One plot at a glance: stage timeline, targets against current readings, "
"trends, and accumulated heat. Edit its schedule, guidance and targets "
"from here."
msgstr "一目了然地檢視單一地塊：階段時間軸、目標與目前讀數的對照、趨勢，以及累積積溫。可在此編輯其排程、指引與目標。"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py:377
msgid "What to monitor"
msgstr "要監看什麼"

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py:383
msgid "Progress"
msgstr ""

#: widgets/AoT_plot.py:385
