#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py
msgid "Temperature first"
msgstr "溫度優先"

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py
msgid "VPD: follows the VPD target directly. Temperature first: follows the stage day/night temperature and turns the VPD target into a humidity target at that temperature, so VPD is not chased with very hot or very cold air; VPD then only acts as a limit. Without a stage temperature, temperature is only kept inside the guide range."
msgstr "VPD：直接追蹤 VPD 目標。溫度優先：追蹤階段的白天/夜間溫度，並把 VPD 目標換算為該溫度下的濕度目標，從而不會用過熱或過冷的空氣去追 VPD；此時 VPD 只作為界限。階段沒有溫度時，只把溫度保持在引導範圍內。"

